// BT-5236: a forwarding proxy. It answers neither the collection messages nor
// `to:do:`, but overrides `doesNotUnderstand:args:`, so the pure send reaches
// the override. An inlined writing fold or counted loop would raise
// `does_not_understand` instead, so it raises `stateful_block_dispatch`.

Actor subclass: Bt5236DnuProxy

  doesNotUnderstand: _selector args: _arguments => #forwarded
